  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_8055.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Las noche del jueves les tocaba la fiesta gastron&oacute;mica a los hombres del barrio del Castillo, en Onda, que han dado buena cuenta de la caldereta y las migas, antes del muy concurrido espect&aacute;culo de &#39;variet&eacute;s&#39;, con el broche estelar del mago Yunke.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestesbarricastellcalderetavarietes/img_8011.jpg\" alt=\"img_8011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestesbarricastellcalderetavarietes/img_8012.jpg\" alt=\"img_8012\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestesbarricastellcalderetavarietes/img_8013.jpg\" alt=\"img_8013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestesbarricastellcalderetavarietes/img_8014.jpg\" alt=\"img_8014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestesbarricastellcalderetavarietes/img_8015.jpg\" alt=\"img_8015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestesbarricastellcalderetavarietes/img_8016.jpg\" alt=\"img_8016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestesbarricastellcalderetavarietes/img_8017.jpg\" alt=\"img_8017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestesbarricastellcalderetavarietes/img_8018.jpg\" alt=\"img_8018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439e